{"3794620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sails", "steam_appid": 3794620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794620/extras/4f18a2efbec5853731186679f1d800b5.avif?t=1787786554\" width=616 height=189 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set sail and live the pirate’s life. <strong>The multiplayer pirate survival game</strong> where you mine, craft and plunder to survive. Form alliances to strengthen your crew and wage war on your enemies. Fight to keep what’s yours before others take it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794620/extras/a85d7588ae911d1b05d92730812e3859.poster.avif?t=1787786554\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794620/extras/a85d7588ae911d1b05d92730812e3859.webm?t=1787786554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794620/extras/a85d7588ae911d1b05d92730812e3859.mp4?t=1787786554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Sails, you step into a <strong>multiplayer world</strong> where piracy rules the seas and every decision can mean life or death. Navigate a vast world alongside friends and build your stronghold to secure your place in this  world. <strong>Explore islands, raid large forts, and form powerful alliances to survive the constant threats from other crews</strong>. Command your ship through intense naval battles where <strong>strategy and teamwork decides the victor</strong>.  In Sails the open ocean is yours to conquer, only if you’re ready to face the dangers lurking beyond the horizon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> SAIL THE SEAS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794620/extras/ad6c41bd3d5c85bf78921660e376deee.avif?t=1787786554\" width=616 height=197 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794620/extras/ee3e5d55777fa58a4791d6fca4767523.poster.avif?t=1787786554\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794620/extras/ee3e5d55777fa58a4791d6fca4767523.webm?t=1787786554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794620/extras/ee3e5d55777fa58a4791d6fca4767523.mp4?t=1787786554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dynamic world ruled by rival factions with each controlling specific regions. Command a variety of ships, from small sloops to powerful galleons. Customize the interior of your ship to suit your playstyle. Navigate treacherous waters and chart your course through danger and opportunity.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Large Open world</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Territories ruled by factions</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Ships</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buildable Ship interior</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>RAID AND PLUNDER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794620/extras/e7a57d49886dd17ee905d2ab3544862c.avif?t=1787786554\" width=616 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794620/extras/a6e10484bf6a822c9dbd07fbcd9122fd.poster.avif?t=1787786554\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794620/extras/a6e10484bf6a822c9dbd07fbcd9122fd.webm?t=1787786554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794620/extras/a6e10484bf6a822c9dbd07fbcd9122fd.mp4?t=1787786554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle rival crews across land and sea in exciting raids. Lay siege to enemy bases, steal their loot, and defend your own from other pirates. Attack on land or use naval bombardment to soften targets. When you're not fighting players, raid NPC towns, tribal villages, and strongholds for extra rewards.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raid rival crews for their loot</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore abandoned ships and shipwrecks</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plunder towns, villages, and forts</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find hidden dungeons</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> BUILD AND CRAFT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794620/extras/082800510dfa8cdaad534e35ef109ae6.avif?t=1787786554\" width=616 height=197 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794620/extras/da20474568ff7f31b642dc249ce53cb6.poster.avif?t=1787786554\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794620/extras/da20474568ff7f31b642dc249ce53cb6.webm?t=1787786554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794620/extras/da20474568ff7f31b642dc249ce53cb6.mp4?t=1787786554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your world from the ground up. Build coastal bases, island forts, or hidden hideouts with your crew. Craft anything from weapons and armor to tools and ship upgrades. Fortify your base, set traps, and prepare for enemy raids. Whether you're the builder or a fighter, survival starts with what you create.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft weapons, tools, armor and ships</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Construct your fortress</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Form a crew with friends</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build traps and fortifications</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794620/extras/4f18a2efbec5853731186679f1d800b5.avif?t=1787786554\" width=616 height=189 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set sail and live the pirate’s life. <strong>The multiplayer pirate survival game</strong> where you mine, craft and plunder to survive. Form alliances to strengthen your crew and wage war on your enemies. Fight to keep what’s yours before others take it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794620/extras/a85d7588ae911d1b05d92730812e3859.poster.avif?t=1787786554\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794620/extras/a85d7588ae911d1b05d92730812e3859.webm?t=1787786554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794620/extras/a85d7588ae911d1b05d92730812e3859.mp4?t=1787786554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Sails, you step into a <strong>multiplayer world</strong> where piracy rules the seas and every decision can mean life or death. Navigate a vast world alongside friends and build your stronghold to secure your place in this  world. <strong>Explore islands, raid large forts, and form powerful alliances to survive the constant threats from other crews</strong>. Command your ship through intense naval battles where <strong>strategy and teamwork decides the victor</strong>.  In Sails the open ocean is yours to conquer, only if you’re ready to face the dangers lurking beyond the horizon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> SAIL THE SEAS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794620/extras/ad6c41bd3d5c85bf78921660e376deee.avif?t=1787786554\" width=616 height=197 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794620/extras/ee3e5d55777fa58a4791d6fca4767523.poster.avif?t=1787786554\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794620/extras/ee3e5d55777fa58a4791d6fca4767523.webm?t=1787786554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794620/extras/ee3e5d55777fa58a4791d6fca4767523.mp4?t=1787786554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dynamic world ruled by rival factions with each controlling specific regions. Command a variety of ships, from small sloops to powerful galleons. Customize the interior of your ship to suit your playstyle. Navigate treacherous waters and chart your course through danger and opportunity.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Large Open world</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Territories ruled by factions</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Ships</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buildable Ship interior</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>RAID AND PLUNDER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794620/extras/e7a57d49886dd17ee905d2ab3544862c.avif?t=1787786554\" width=616 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794620/extras/a6e10484bf6a822c9dbd07fbcd9122fd.poster.avif?t=1787786554\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794620/extras/a6e10484bf6a822c9dbd07fbcd9122fd.webm?t=1787786554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794620/extras/a6e10484bf6a822c9dbd07fbcd9122fd.mp4?t=1787786554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle rival crews across land and sea in exciting raids. Lay siege to enemy bases, steal their loot, and defend your own from other pirates. Attack on land or use naval bombardment to soften targets. When you're not fighting players, raid NPC towns, tribal villages, and strongholds for extra rewards.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raid rival crews for their loot</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore abandoned ships and shipwrecks</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plunder towns, villages, and forts</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find hidden dungeons</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> BUILD AND CRAFT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794620/extras/082800510dfa8cdaad534e35ef109ae6.avif?t=1787786554\" width=616 height=197 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794620/extras/da20474568ff7f31b642dc249ce53cb6.poster.avif?t=1787786554\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794620/extras/da20474568ff7f31b642dc249ce53cb6.webm?t=1787786554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794620/extras/da20474568ff7f31b642dc249ce53cb6.mp4?t=1787786554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your world from the ground up. Build coastal bases, island forts, or hidden hideouts with your crew. Craft anything from weapons and armor to tools and ship upgrades. Fortify your base, set traps, and prepare for enemy raids. Whether you're the builder or a fighter, survival starts with what you create.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft weapons, tools, armor and ships</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Construct your fortress</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Form a crew with friends</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build traps and fortifications</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "short_description": "Plunder, craft and live the pirate’s life. This is a multiplayer pirate survival game where you mine, craft, trade and plunder to survive. Form alliances with other players to strengthen your crew and wage war on your enemies. Fight to keep what’s yours before others take it.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Korean, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794620/73f29038edebde361a202e1a4513d914702c4287/header.jpg?t=1787786554", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794620/244f26ccc19a43ca7fc9eca18dae2504d1645012/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787786554", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794620/244f26ccc19a43ca7fc9eca18dae2504d1645012/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787786554", "website": "https://www.playsails.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600K @ 3.50 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 950<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor 